        <mxCell id="card-legend-notes" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;Large dashed frame: infra perimeter · small: functional group&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#fb923c&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;⚠ Gx&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;: docs and code disagree, see &quot;Gaps&quot;&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#94a3b8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="1720" width="660" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-data-plane" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#22d3ee&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Request path · a preview from PR to results&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; A maintainer (or an agent) opens a same-repo PR in Provisioning, Mods or Proxy and adds the preview label.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt; CI builds an immutable bundle (regenerated index.json, built jars) to Garage previews/&amp;lt;repo&amp;gt;-pr&amp;lt;n&amp;gt;/&amp;lt;sha&amp;gt;/.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;3&lt;/span&gt; The ApplicationSet PR generator polls GitHub (every 180 s or a webhook) and makes one Application per PR.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;4&lt;/span&gt; Argo CD syncs it in project arffornia-preview to ns arffornia-pr-&amp;lt;repo&amp;gt;-&amp;lt;n&amp;gt;, PSA restricted.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;5&lt;/span&gt; The config-updater pulls the bundle instead of main: BASE_URL is the only change.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;6&lt;/span&gt; The server uses its own 1-instance Zalando Postgres; credentials stay in the namespace, no Vault.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;7&lt;/span&gt; A post-sync Job waits for Done, runs rcon-cli tests (/forge mods, /gametest runall), greps logs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;8&lt;/span&gt; It posts a JUnit summary and logs as a PR comment. Closing the PR deletes the namespace.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#0b1222;strokeColor=#1e293b;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#e2e8f0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="770" y="1440" width="900" height="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-guardrails" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#fb7185&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Guardrails&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;• AppProject arffornia-preview: destinations arffornia-pr-* only; VaultSecret, PV, LoadBalancer and cluster-scoped kinds denied.&lt;br&gt;• ResourceQuota 8 GiB / 3 CPU and a LimitRange per preview; a cap on concurrent previews.&lt;br&gt;• Default-deny NetworkPolicy: egress to the internet (mod CDNs) and its own DB only; no cluster CIDRs, no 192.168.1.0/24.&lt;br&gt;• automountServiceAccountToken: false. Never on fork PRs: a PR jar is arbitrary Java.&lt;br&gt;• Access: mc-router behind one MetalLB IP, pr-&amp;lt;n&amp;gt;.preview.arffornia.com on LAN/VPN; offline-mode off, whitelist on.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#0b1222;strokeColor=#1e293b;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#e2e8f0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1700" y="1440" width="640" height="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-open" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#fb923c&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Open questions&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;• Q1 Capacity: a 300-mod pack needs 8-16 GiB per server; node headroom is unknown.&lt;br&gt;• Q2 Website API for previews: stub, shared staging or per-PR instance.&lt;br&gt;• Q3 Release channels: keep main as production, or add a stable tag and treat main as staging.&lt;br&gt;• Prerequisite: per-namespace Vault roles (G4), or previews could read every Arffornia secret.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#0b1222;strokeColor=#1e293b;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#e2e8f0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2370" y="1440" width="490" height="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
